# Normalise line endings.
#
# Without this, a Windows clone rewrites every file to CRLF on checkout and
# `git status` reports all tracked files as fully modified (1032 insertions,
# 1032 deletions on the initial clone), which makes every diff to the
# execution server unreadable.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
